{'symbol': 'PPL', 'date': '2021-03-18 03:14:00', 'title': 'THE NARRAGANSETT ELECTRIC COMPANY TO JOIN PPL CORPORATION', 'text': "PROVIDENCE, R.I.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NATIONAL GRID PLC (LSE: NG, NYSE: NGG) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE WESTERN POWER DISTRIBUTION, THE UK'S LARGEST ELECTRICITY DISTRIBUTION BUSINESS, FROM PPL CORPORATION (NYSE: PPL) FOR AN EQUITY VALUE OF £7.8 BILLION. IN PARALLEL, WITH PPL WISHING TO EXPAND ITS PRESENCE IN THE U.S., NATIONAL GRID HAS AGREED TO PPL ACQUIRING THE NARRAGANSETT ELECTRIC COMPANY, NATIONAL GRID'S ELECTRIC AND GAS BUSINESS SERVING CUSTOMERS IN RHODE ISLAND, FOR AN EQUITY"}{'symbol': 'PPL', 'date': '2021-03-18 03:00:00', 'title': "PPL CORPORATION TO SELL U.K. UTILITY BUSINESS TO NATIONAL GRID AND ACQUIRE NATIONAL GRID'S RHODE ISLAND UTILITY, STRATEGICALLY REPOSITIONING PPL AS A HIGH-GROWTH, U.S.-FOCUSED ENERGY COMPANY", 'text': "ALLENTOWN, PA., MARCH 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PPL CORPORATION (NYSE: PPL) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO DEFINITIVE AGREEMENTS TO SELL ITS U.K. UTILITY BUSINESS, WESTERN POWER DISTRIBUTION (WPD), TO NATIONAL GRID PLC FOR £7.8 BILLION AND, IN A SEPARATE TRANSACTION, TO ACQUIRE NATIONAL GRID'S RHODE ISLAND UTILITY BUSINESS, THE NARRAGANSETT ELECTRIC COMPANY, FOR $3.8 BILLION."}